id: hac-lda1
title: Add agent-native repairs and related-resource diagnostics
description: "Expose Home Assistant 2026.8 repairs and search/related contracts as typed, bounded, format-stable CLI workflows for agent diagnosis and safe remediation."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 0
tags[7]: agents,diagnostics,home-assistant,repairs,search,topology,websocket
