  "2026-08-05T19:18:15.202Z",codex-root,Repairs combines read-only WebSocket issue discovery/data with mutating ignore and admin REST data-entry flows; search/related returns type-keyed resource sets and can surface upstream unknown_error for some valid integration roots.
