body: "Research official Home Assistant developer documentation and Core 2026.8.0 source; implement typed Repairs issue discovery/detail/ignore/fix-flow operations and related-resource topology search; preserve read-only enforcement, bounded deterministic output, all formatter contracts, setup health, privacy-safe live proof, and generic WebSocket passthrough."
